function [hs, taus] = fmr_spare_need(h, tau)
%FMR_SPARE_NEED  The spare ring's momentum and torque: the root sum square of the three rings' (h, tau each).
%   h: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   tau: real[1] (passed a plain number)
